        "text": "现在往水里加一样东西:盐。一勺、两勺、三勺,搅一搅,盐化进水里了。",
        "audio": "s04.mp3"
      },
      {
        "bricks": [
          { "brick": "science.liquid", "params": { "container": "cup", "kind": "water", "solute": "salt", "level": 0.7 } },
          { "brick": "science.egg", "params": { "container": "cup", "position": "surface", "motion": "float" } }
        ],
        "text": "再把鸡蛋放进去,它浮起来了!水有了盐,就变重了,托得住鸡蛋了。",
        "audio": "s05.mp3"
      }
    ]
  },
